.TH "VINPUT\-DAEMON" "1" "November 2026" "fcitx5\-vinput" "fcitx5\-vinput User Manual"
.SH NAME
vinput\-daemon \- Background speech recognition and processing daemon
for fcitx5\-vinput
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]vinput\-daemon\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\-\-log\-level\f[R]=\f[I]LEVEL\f[R]
Set log filtering threshold: \f[CR]trace\f[R], \f[CR]debug\f[R],
\f[CR]info\f[R], \f[CR]warn\f[R], \f[CR]error\f[R], \f[CR]critical\f[R],
\f[CR]off\f[R] (default: \f[CR]info\f[R]).
Can also be specified via the \f[CR]VINPUT_LOG_LEVEL\f[R] environment
variable.
.SH DESCRIPTION
\f[B]vinput\-daemon\f[R] is the background service component of
\f[B]fcitx5\-vinput\f[R].
It communicates with the Fcitx5 addon over D\-Bus
(\f[CR]org.fcitx.Vinput\f[R]).
.PP
The daemon is responsible for:
.IP \(bu 2
Capturing microphone and monitor audio via \f[B]PulseAudio\f[R] /
\f[B]pipewire\-pulse\f[R] (\f[CR]libpulse\f[R]).
.IP \(bu 2
Offline speech\-to\-text recognition powered by \f[B]sherpa\-onnx\f[R].
.IP \(bu 2
Forwarding streaming or batch audio to cloud ASR provider scripts.
.IP \(bu 2
Voice Activity Detection (\f[B]VAD\f[R]) to filter silence.
.IP \(bu 2
Post\-processing and rewriting recognized text using OpenAI\-compatible
LLM APIs.
.IP \(bu 2
Managing background LLM adapter processes.
.IP \(bu 2
Dynamic system audio ducking via \f[B]libpulse\f[R] during recording.
.SH RUNTIME LIFECYCLE & SERVICE
\f[B]vinput\-daemon\f[R] is designed to run as a systemd user service or
start on demand via D\-Bus activation.
.TP
Start daemon immediately:
\f[CR]systemctl \-\-user start vinput\-daemon.service\f[R]
.TP
Enable daemon on user login:
\f[CR]systemctl \-\-user enable \-\-now vinput\-daemon.service\f[R]
.TP
View daemon logs:
\f[CR]journalctl \-\-user \-u vinput\-daemon.service \-f\f[R]
.SH ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
.TP
\f[B]VINPUT_LOG_LEVEL\f[R]
Log filtering threshold: \f[CR]trace\f[R], \f[CR]debug\f[R],
\f[CR]info\f[R], \f[CR]warn\f[R], \f[CR]error\f[R], \f[CR]critical\f[R],
\f[CR]off\f[R] (default: \f[CR]info\f[R]).
Set to \f[CR]debug\f[R] or \f[CR]trace\f[R] for verbose troubleshooting
logs.
.TP
\f[B]VINPUT_CONFIG_PATH\f[R]
Override the path to \f[CR]config.json\f[R].
.SH PRIVACY & AUDIO CAPTURE
While idle, the daemon keeps only a lightweight control context open and
\f[B]never opens a recording stream or buffers microphone audio\f[R]
until a voice session starts.
Upon stopping or aborting a session, the capture stream is immediately
disconnected.
.SH FILES
.TP
\f[I]\(ti/.config/vinput/config.json\f[R]
Primary daemon configuration file.
.TP
\f[I]/usr/share/systemd/user/vinput\-daemon.service\f[R]
Systemd user unit definition.
.TP
\f[I]/usr/share/dbus\-1/services/org.fcitx.Vinput.service\f[R]
D\-Bus activation service file.
